        "original_id": "7dc3e04e-9a07-5393-bfcc-c4608a72b527",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Aerodynamik, Tour de France Soundtracks\n- Organizations: Kraftwerk\n- Events: 100th anniversary of the first Tour de France bicycle race\n\nFacts:\n- Tour de France Soundtracks is Kraftwerk's tenth studio album, and it was intended for release to mark the 100th anniversary of the first Tour de France bicycle race.\n- Tour de France Soundtracks ultimately missed its intended release date for the actual Tour de France.\n- Aerodynamik was released on 15 March 2004 as the fourth single from Kraftwerk's 2003 album Tour de France Soundtracks.",
